{"id": "fr-inflection-0001", "language": "fr", "text": "C'est l'avis d'Hélène Garnier ; selon Garnier, le délai était trop court.", "spans": [{"start": 15, "end": 29, "entity_type": "PERSON", "text": "Hélène Garnier"}, {"start": 38, "end": 45, "entity_type": "PERSON", "text": "Garnier"}], "meta": {"kind": "inflection", "tags": ["elision", "standalone-surname"]}}
{"id": "fr-inflection-0002", "language": "fr", "text": "Le contrat a été signé par M. Lefèvre et Mme Camille Roussel.", "spans": [{"start": 30, "end": 37, "entity_type": "PERSON", "text": "Lefèvre"}, {"start": 45, "end": 60, "entity_type": "PERSON", "text": "Camille Roussel"}], "meta": {"kind": "inflection", "tags": ["title"]}}
{"id": "fr-inflection-0003", "language": "fr", "text": "Bonjour Hélène, peux-tu transmettre le dossier à Bruno Masson ? L'adresse d'Masson a changé.", "spans": [{"start": 8, "end": 14, "entity_type": "PERSON", "text": "Hélène"}, {"start": 49, "end": 61, "entity_type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno Masson"}, {"start": 76, "end": 82, "entity_type": "PERSON", "text": "Masson"}], "meta": {"kind": "inflection", "tags": ["given-only", "elision"]}}
{"id": "fr-inflection-0004", "language": "fr", "text": "Les témoins, Paul Girard et Inès Chevalier, ont confirmé la date. Seule Chevalier a vu le véhicule.", "spans": [{"start": 13, "end": 24, "entity_type": "PERSON", "text": "Paul Girard"}, {"start": 28, "end": 42, "entity_type": "PERSON", "text": "Inès Chevalier"}, {"start": 72, "end": 81, "entity_type": "PERSON", "text": "Chevalier"}], "meta": {"kind": "inflection", "tags": ["standalone-surname"]}}
